<h1>UB-tree</h1>
<p>
(data structure)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
Refers to either <a href="universalBTree.html"><em>universal B-tree</em></a> or <a href="unlimitedBranchingTree.html"><em>unlimited branching tree</em></a>.
</p>


<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

Go to the
<a href="https://www.nist.gov/dads/">Dictionary of Algorithms and Data
Structures</a> home page.

